!jai'i SE
!!!fai'i FA

'''''jai'i''''':
Move old x1 to '''''fai'i'''''-tagged place. New x1 is sumti raised out of fai'i-tagged old x1.

Works like ''jai broda'', except that it allows ''jai BAI jai'i broda ... fai ko'a ... fai'i ko'e''.

--((And)).
